OL,3,GNEWSAFestival 'devastated' as man dies
OL,4,Aafter sign falls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the festival said:
OL,7,F"We are devastated by the serious
OL,8,Fincident that took place at Big Church
OL,9,FFestival 2026 today, in which a sign
OL,10,Ffell, injuring at least seven people,
OL,11,Fone of whom tragically lost their
OL,12,Flife."
